# What the otel-collector form, booted as it ships, without a shell and
# without a config, must say on its console (make
# check-shellfree-otel-collector; test/boot; forms/demo/test/console has
# the format). Given no certificate, the collector parks before anything
# is rendered or bound, and says why. make check-otel-collector boots it
# with its config, and sends it spans.

seen    otel-needs-config  leash: \{"event":"down","service":"otel-collector","why":"config tls-cert: FileNotFound"\}
unseen  otel-ran           Everything is ready
